# Constructive Engagement Example:

Given the intricate dynamics involved in international trade policies and global relations, particularly concerning China-US tensions, approaching dialogue with thoughtfulness is paramount. For instance,

- Emphasizing mutual benefits when highlighting bilateral cooperation could pave a constructive path towards resolving conflicts;

- Acknowledging historical context helps understand underlying complexities which shape present-day attitudes;

- Proposing viable middle grounds focusing on win-win outcomes instead of confrontations aids in finding common ground;

- Advocating peaceful resolutions

